meta {
  name: 05 batch status
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{photoUploadIngressBase}}/internal/photo-upload/batches/{{batchId}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  Reports the state of each file in the batch that request 03 presigned (HOMELAB-135). Run it after 04.
  Expect 200 with "complete" and a "files" list. A file is "accepted" when ingest filed it, "rejected" with
  the reason from ingest, "duplicate", or "pending" while ingest is still deciding. A file still pending after
  15 minutes is "failed". 404 means the batch is unknown; run 03 first.
}
